 "notes": "User mode (MID port): knobs 1-8 = macros of the selected instrument, knob 9 = its pan, faders 1-8 = track levels 1-8, master fader = volume. DAW mode (DAW port, Mackie): transport, Save, Undo, Metro, Part / bank buttons = instrument / preset, encoders = macros, faders 1-8 = levels. Pads 1-8 send notes 36-43 on the keys' channel: turn FX keys on (the PERFORM toggle, Ctrl+Shift+K) and they hold the performance effects; off, they play.",
